blocks.plainText:
Upon satisfactory inspection of service equipment and the satisfaction of all the requirements for sign-off, the department shall issue a certificate of compliance as applicable for the following service equipment:

 1. Elevators;

 2. Escalators;

 3. Moving walkways;

 4. Heating systems; and

 5. Dumbwaiters.

